OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers voting on independence
OL,4,Aover asylum plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoters in a small village are heading
OL,7,Fto the polls for an independence vote
OL,8,Fover government plans to house asylum
OL,9,Fseekers nearby former Ministry of
OL,10,FDefence (MoD) site.
OL,12,FThe residents of Piddington, in
OL,13,FOxfordshire, are voting over Home
OL,14,FOffice proposals to house up to 1,256
OL,15,Fmale asylum seekers at nearby MoD
OL,16,FBicester.
OL,18,FThe symbolic referendum on whether to
OL,19,Fleave the UK has been organised by the
OL,20,Flocal parish council, with polling
OL,21,Ftaking place between 07:00 and 19:00
OL,22,FBST.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
