OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers voting on independence
OL,4,Aover asylum plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of the vote, council chair Tim
OL,7,FMcNally said the government "does not
OL,8,Fwant to engage with villagers
OL,9,Fconcerns".
